<view class="page-container page-container--padded"><top-bar title="身份核验" back="true"></top-bar><view class="page-shell__description">姓名和学号只用于学校身份核验，不会显示在树洞中。核验成功后，系统会生成默认匿名身份。</view><view class="section-title">姓名</view><input class="input" value="{{name}}" bindinput="onNameInput" placeholder="请输入姓名" /><view class="section-title">学号</view><input class="input" value="{{studentNumber}}" bindinput="onStudentInput" placeholder="请输入学号" /><state-message wx:if="{{error}}" title="核验未完成" message="{{error}}"></state-message><primary-button label="开始核验" loading="{{loading}}" bindaction="submit"></primary-button><primary-button label="稍后再做" secondary="true" bindaction="cancel"></primary-button></view>
